<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 3 Best in Slot Gear list for Restoration Shaman Healer in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, BoE World drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Restoration Shaman Healer in Phase 3</h2>Restoration <a class="icontiny c7" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/shaman">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_shaman.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shaman</span></a> Tier 8 set has an excellent 4p bonus in <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64922/item-shaman-t8-restoration-4p-bonus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Item - Shaman T8 Restoration 4P Bonus</span></a>, which is equivalent to a huge (~8.7% or 400 to 450 rating) Haste increase for our main heal, and <b>acquiring <span class="c4">4 set</span> should always be your number one priority</b>, no matter the item level or slot of the Tier piece. Even with <b>Tier 9</b> out, the difference in power of the set bonus makes <b>Tier 8 still worth using in most situations.</b>
<br/>
<br/>While <b>Spell Haste</b> is the best stat for increasing your throughput and ability to reactively heal, stacking it does come at a cost to your Mana pool if you are spamming heals without pause. Gemming pure <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40128/quick-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick King's Amber</span></a> is a strong throughput option but comes at a very high Mana cost when compared to using mostly <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a>, and thus would mostly be recommended for short fights or for Yellow sockets.<br/>
<br/>Below are two example sets of gear with full Mail and any armor type BiS without any profession assumptions, although <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> with its unique gear enchants and bombs is recommended.<br/>
