<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Restoration Shaman Healer in Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Restoration Shaman Healer in Phase 3</h3>
<span class="socket-meta q0"></span>
<b>Meta sockets</b> are unique to head slot pieces and accept meta gems (instead of regular gems). Only a single meta socket may exist in any given piece, and many pieces come without a meta socket at all. The best meta gem for Restoration <a class="icontiny c7" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/shaman">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_shaman.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shaman</span></a>s in Phase 3 is the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41401/insightful-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insightful Earthsiege Diamond</span></a>, which is great for Mana sustain, and only requires one gem of each color.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46201/conquerors-worldbreaker-headpiece">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_69.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Worldbreaker Headpiece</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45402/valorous-worldbreaker-headpiece">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_69.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Worldbreaker Headpiece</span></a> are the two best helms, sporting great stats and enabling the powerful 4-set bonus from Tier 8. Any other high level helmet will suffice until you can get one of them, but it should not be too difficult, as you can acquire <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45639/crown-of-the-wayward-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of the Wayward Protector</span></a> with <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a>, if unlucky!<br/>
<br/>The <b>Elemental</b> Tier 9 set helms are also very strong, and can be used instead in a situation where you primarily need to single-target heal.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44159/arcanum-of-burning-mysteries">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Burning Mysteries</span></a>
