<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_paladin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Paladin</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45616/star-beaded-clutch">
