<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinket for Restoration Shaman Healer in Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47059/solace-of-the-defeated">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduar77_25man.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solace of the Defeated</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47432/solace-of-the-fallen">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduar77_25man.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solace of the Fallen</span></a> are the best trinkets available by far, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45535/show-of-faith">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_improvedresistanceauras.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Show of Faith</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a> being the best trinkets to pair with the Solaces, with your choice coming down to the extra Mana sustain from Show of Faith against the burst throughput provided by Scale of Fates. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=37111/soul-preserver">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_orb_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Preserver</span></a> is also still very strong, as its effect can proc from each <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55459/chain-heal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_healingwavegreater.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chain Heal</span></a> jump, making it save much more Mana overall (100 Mp5+ equivalent) than it would appear at first glance.<br/>
<br/>There are also multiple easier to obtain alternatives such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45929/sifs-remembrance">
