<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons for Restoration Shaman Healer in Phase 3</h2>Staves and other two-handed weapons generally grant less total spell damage than a MH+OH combo, and also lack the extra armor and block a shield provides, making a MH+OH generally superior if its stats are comparable to the best two-handed weapon available.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-restoration-shaman-healer-in-phase-3">Weapons for Restoration Shaman Healer in Phase 3</h4>
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46017/valanyr-hammer-of-ancient-kings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Val'anyr, Hammer of Ancient Kings</span></a> is the best healer weapon in Wrath overall, and if you ever manage to pick it up it will be hard to replace throughout the whole expansion. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47483/sufferings-end">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_103.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Suffering's End</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47206/miserys-end">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_107.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Misery's End</span></a> are solid alternatives if you are not a Val'anyr holder, having similar stats but lacking the critical legendary power typically adding around 5% of your healing.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45612/constellus">
