<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shields-off-hands-for-restoration-shaman-healer-in-phase-3">Shields /<wbr/> Off-Hands for Restoration Shaman Healer in Phase 3</h4>Whenever possible, try to use shields if they have comparable stats to the off-hands at your disposal, as that will make any physical damage that comes your way much more manageable and they can be enchanted.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47085/bastion-of-purity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_69.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bastion of Purity</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47448/bastion-of-resolve">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bastion of Resolve</span></a> are the best shields available, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45470/wisdoms-hold">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_65.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wisdom's Hold</span></a> is also very strong. Until you obtain one of these, you can also use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45887/ice-layered-barrier">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_65.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ice Layered Barrier</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40401/voice-of-reason">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_63.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Voice of Reason</span></a>.<br/>
